@Laura Lopez Are these two designs corresponding to "Ongoing" (left) vs "1st run" (right), or alternatives?

Overall, it seems correct that we might take more real estate for "1st run" than for "ongoing" as we need to have a bit more clarity as to what we are offering.

We probably want to have the text line up with the title of the modal that would show up. In this case, it seems that the user is clicking on "Protect against email spam" and then lands on Sign up for a free email mask", which might be jarring.
